Package: PathwayLGM
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Pathway Inference with INLA
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("PathwayLGM research contributors", role = "aut"),
    person("Research handoff maintainer", role = "cre",
           email = "maintainer@example.org"))
Description: Fits pathway models with a shared baseline intercept, relative
    regional effects and conditionally independent regional gene effects. The
    observed mode models normalised expression as Gaussian and is fitted in
    closed form, for one section or jointly for adjacent sections that share
    the regional effects; the adjusted mode models raw counts as negative
    binomial with a cell-type composition offset, so that regional differences
    are adjusted for composition, and is fitted with INLA. Computes directional
    pathway probabilities and posterior tail probabilities from Gaussian
    mixtures over the hyperparameters. Includes a command-line interface that
    runs every gene set of a GMT file.
